"A selectee who signs the Contract receives an additional gift."
"Refusing to sign forfeits the bonus, though the selectee must serve anyway."
"Refusers still become superhuman and are deprioritized for summons, not deleted."
"The Fragile Atmosphere is offered to almost every class as a signing gift."
"It is single-use life support: about six minutes of Earth air, gravity and pressure."
"Stat signing bonuses are given as an equivalent soul enchantment, a fairly expensive gift."
"Wardrobe Change as a bonus is fully System-run and never exhausts, but fails where no System is."
